


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_7a5e7c7f:


    "屋里只有阳菜和文两个人。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_3e66b652:


    "今天是两人可以独处的日子，伦和圣夜子暂时都不会回来。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_b66f72e8:


    "虽然从两人凌乱的头发和不整的着装可以看出是事后了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_99c2b8f9:


    "却不是平时的亲密气氛。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_b725b571:


    "文坐在那里重新扎好头发，而阳菜坐在她旁边怀抱着膝。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_3b7bc4b1:



    voice "2HI_1202"
    hina "「抱歉，做的还是不是很好」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_4029aa49:


    "阳菜看着自己的手指嘟囔道。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_22f2cb0f:



    voice "2FU_0951"
    fumi "「怎、怎么会，我才是……对不起」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_d3fdb029:


    "文忙摇摇头，也向阳菜道歉。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_4c8cc8e8:


    "仅仅是贴在一起就已经觉得很幸福了。一直这样有说有笑过来的两人，今天却无法如此了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_1b5e02cd:



    voice "2HI_1203"
    hina "「总是做不好……是不是因为这事本来就不正常呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_f1fd9b93:



    voice "2FU_0952"
    fumi "「不正常……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_338d06a9:



    voice "2HI_1204"
    hina "「因为我们两人都是女生」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_38345653:



    voice "2FU_0953"
    fumi "「和那个没关系！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_3427d0a0:


    "文马上否定道。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_82ae73dd:



    voice "2HI_1205"
    hina "「……小文好吓人」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_76861eb4:


    "十分强硬的表情。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_af096deb:



    voice "2FU_0954"
    fumi "「阳菜你怎么了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_7777a2c7:



    voice "2HI_1206"
    hina "「或许是我们错了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_bd2ff7c5:



    voice "2FU_0955"
    fumi "「才……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_a8cd2905:


    "文想说的一定是「才没有错！」。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_8905ed58:


    "前天的LIME那件事使两人的想法发生了变化。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_3ba57a62:


    "牵着彼此的手，从此一直携手走下去。这对两人来说本是理所当然的事情。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_fc400fd7:


    "但对于其他人来说，这是理所当然的吗？"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_b951b26b:


    "滴落下来的那一滴不安在天真的二人心里渗透，扩散开来。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_dea5a58a:


    hina_fumi "「那个……」\n「那、那个……」" (what_rest_indent=0)


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_34b0970d:


    "同时开口，接着再次沉默了一会。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_ff66ec9b:


    hina_fumi "「比起我这样的——」\n「比起我这样的——」" (what_rest_indent=0)


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_e3685d53:


    "两人下定决心后再次同时开口，但马上明白了对方想说什么，把后面的话咽了回去。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_1f91f5ab:


    "两人异常的关系或许逼得对方成为了异端。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_d4802878:



    voice "2HI_1209"
    hina "「毕业后还能和我做朋友吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_5fb162d1:


    "文点点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_e6d6e39c:



    voice "2FU_0958"
    fumi "「永远都会。我绝对不会忘记你的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_90a902f7:



    voice "2HI_1210"
    hina "「嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_03_9ea51742:


    "两人紧紧握住彼此的手。"
